include/dsmLongRow.cuh adapts the asynchronous DSM reduction protocol from
quack/reduce.py (cluster_reduce), quack/utils.py (store_shared_remote), and
quack/reduction_base.py (_initialize_cluster). Changes: CUDA C++/PTX rather
than CuTe-DSL, FP64 arithmetic, CSR dot products, grouped row tasks, optional
short-row fusion, and a synchronous pull-based control. Quack is not a
runtime dependency. The accompanying LICENSE is the upstream Apache-2.0
license, not a license declaration for the rest of this repository.
